{"script":"s_0_2_2","des":"米托拉，看看这张床！","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","bright":1,"img":"chara002_2","x":360,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"y":-180,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2o"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","bright":1,"img":"chara002_2","x":360,"mirrow":false,"scaleY":1,"transTime":300,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"y":-180,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2o"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]哇——太厉害了吧，{myName}！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这两年间我一直在草坪上打地铺……能睡在床上过夜，我想都不敢想……！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]什么？要、要我睡上去试试？那、那怎么行！我才不要！[r][l]啊，不是说这张床不好的意思，我的意思是——就算要睡，也得等……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]嗯？需要试用报告，好改良之后的家具？呃[wait=300]…[wait=200]…[wait=100][r]我、我知道了啦！等今晚冒险结束的时候我会去试的啦……！ [l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}